<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="aa16ead">The benefits team should monitor the execution of the identified actions within the completed action plan. Updates on the
progress of these actions should be provided to the program or project leadership. If insufficient improvement is
identified for the underperforming benefit, further analysis should be undertaken prior to a new action plan being agreed
with program leadership. One option that should be considered is whether the original forecast for the benefit is valid and
if this is to be changed, it should be discussed with the stakeholders.</attribute>
